Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Staging|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Activate Deactivate Remote Staging
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|tunneling.servlet.shared.secret=1234567890123456${line.separator}auth.verifier.TunnelAuthVerifier.hosts.allowed=|
	When Staging remote Staging Set Up
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And DMDocument add PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.docx|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|stagingActivated|true|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Remote Site|
	And DMPortlet set Descriptive View
	And DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging deactivate Staging CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Remote Site|
	Then DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
